  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sunny0826/kubecm/zipball/v0.36.0",
  "body": "## Upgrade notes\n\nBuilding from source now requires **Go 1.25.0 or newer**. The project's mise configuration pins Go 1.25.14 and the validation tools used by CI.\n\n## What's Changed\n\n- **Restore `--context-name` overrides.** Importing a context with `--context-name dev-85` now saves it as `dev-85`, instead of prepending the name to the original context. This fixes the regression introduced in v0.35.0 for file and standard-input imports. Existing collision handling is preserved. [#1207](https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/pull/1207)\n- **Consolidate dependency updates.** Update Kubernetes client-go, api and apimachinery to v0.35.2; Azure identity to v1.13.1; Azure Container Service v4 to v4.8.0; Tencent Cloud common to v1.3.51; `golang.org/x/crypto` to v0.52.0; and `golang.org/x/net` to v0.55.0. The Kubernetes dependency graph also upgrades gorilla/websocket beyond v1.5.3. [#1208](https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/pull/1208)\n- **Make dependency validation reproducible.** Pin development tools with mise, update Kubernetes test APIs, remove live GitHub-release dependencies from unit tests, and add package race tests, module consistency checks, and workflow validation to CI. [#1208](https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/pull/1208)\n- **Improve integration-test reliability.** Reuse existing Kind cluster configurations for range-deletion fixtures while retaining real-cluster integration coverage. [#1207](https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/pull/1207)\n- Fix the README Star History chart. [#1199](https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/pull/1199)\n- Refresh CI and release actions, including checkout, coverage reporting, and Homebrew formula updates.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sunny0826/kubecm/compare/v0.35.1...v0.36.0\n"
}
